  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Stung, the Martians fell back to their pit on Horsell Common, dragging their dead machine.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 6.31
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Had they pushed on, nothing but a few guns stood between them and London.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 8.792,
      "seconds": 5.26
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "They were in no hurry. And every hour, another gun was dug in.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 16.292,
      "seconds": 4.78
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I had found a boat, drifting empty down the steaming river.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 23.292,
      "seconds": 3.95
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "No oars. I paddled with my scalded hands, looking behind me all the way.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 29.458,
      "seconds": 6.16
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Halliford was deserted. The houses burned in silence, with no crowd to watch them.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 37.833,
      "seconds": 6.28
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Inland, a line of fire marched across a field of hay.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 46.333,
      "seconds": 3.89
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "At Walton bridge my fever beat my fear, and I crawled ashore.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 52.458,
      "seconds": 4.82
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I woke to a stranger beside me, staring at a flicker in the sky.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 63.208,
      "seconds": 4.31
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Have you any water?",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 69.75,
      "seconds": 1.84
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He shook his head. I had been asking for water, he said, for an hour.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 73.792,
      "seconds": 5.54
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "curate",
      "text": "What sins have we done?",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 81.542,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A curate. After morning service he had walked out, into fire and death.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 86.708,
      "seconds": 5.5
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "What are we?",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 94.417,
      "seconds": 0.96
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "His church, rebuilt three years ago, was gone. His whole parish, swept away.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 97.583,
      "seconds": 6.98
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "curate",
      "text": "The smoke of her burning goeth up for ever and ever!",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 106.792,
      "seconds": 3.81
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Be a man!",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 112.833,
      "seconds": 0.96
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "curate",
      "text": "They are pitiless.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 117.625,
      "seconds": 1.73
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "One of them was killed yonder, not three hours ago.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 121.583,
      "seconds": 3.34
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Killed? He stared about him, as if God's own ministers could not die.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 127.333,
      "seconds": 5.56
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I had seen it happen. We had simply come in for the thick of it.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 135.125,
      "seconds": 4.18
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "That flicker was a heliograph. Beyond those hills, men were placing guns.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 141.542,
      "seconds": 6.0
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "curate",
      "text": "Listen!",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 150.167,
      "seconds": 0.77
    }
  ],
  "plan": "974f810faa5a5ad9"
}